Subject: [PATCH 82/82] temp/libcamera: phase detection autofocus for the main
 camera

Add libcamera 0015-0017: the simple pipeline captures the phase detection
stream of the IMX689 and the autofocus jumps to focus with it before a short
contrast search. Tuning for the IMX689.
