+From f614076a69686357514034443a1506f2f6a43341 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:18:56 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 16/17] pipeline: simple: Capture the phase detection stream of
+ the IMX689
+
+The IMX689 sends its phase detection pixels in the 4000x3000 mode as a
+second CSI-2 stream (virtual channel 1, data type 0x30), a 2000x1500 image
+with the left and right pixels in alternating columns. On Qualcomm CAMSS the
+CSID passes it to the RDI after the one of the image when the qcom_camss
+module parameters rdi_vc and rdi_dt are set for that RDI.
+
+When the sensor runs in that mode, capture the stream on that RDI, measure
+the shift between the left and right pixels in the centre of the image by
+cross-correlation and pass it to the software ISP statistics.
+---
+ src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp | 312 +++++++++++++++++++++++
+ 1 file changed, 312 insertions(+)
+
+diff --git a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+index 002b222..08442bf 100644
+--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
++++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+@@ -7,6 +7,8 @@
+  */
+ 
